      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Example: \"initech_app\" client has:\n\n📁  Local folder on Hermes machine\n☁️  Google Drive folder (same name)\n📋  Kanban board (same name)\n💬  Slack + Telegram channels (same\nnames)\n\nEach profile has its own SOUL:\n\n   SOUL.md     — agent identity\n   MEMORY.md   — project knowledge\n   USER.md     — how Chana works\n                    with this client",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "profile-box",
      "originalText": "Example: \"initech_app\" client has:\n\n📁  Local folder on Hermes machine\n☁️  Google Drive folder (same name)\n📋  Kanban board (same name)\n💬  Slack + Telegram channels (same names)\n\nEach profile has its own SOUL:\n\n   SOUL.md     — agent identity\n   MEMORY.md   — project knowledge\n   USER.md     — how Chana works\n                    with this client",
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "baseline": 26,
      "version": 236,
      "index": "aA",
      "autoResize": true
    },
